{"seq":3,"slug":"history-advanced","title":"文科方向历史进阶","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":3,"docCount":9,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/humanities-track/history-advanced","introMarkdown":"# 文科方向历史进阶 简介\n\n历史进阶是高中文科方向中历史学科的深度拓展课程，在高一中外古代史和高二中外近现代史的基础上，从具体历史知识的学习上升到历史学方法论和专题研究的层次。常规历史课程按时间线梳理重大事件和发展脉络，而历史进阶则追问\"如何研究历史\"——史料如何甄别、历史叙述如何建构、不同文明如何比较。这种从\"学历史\"到\"做历史\"的转变，是历史学科核心素养的最高体现。\n\n本知识库面向历史基础扎实、希望提升历史思维深度的高中文科学生，适合已完成高一、高二历史课程，对历史研究方法或历史学专业有兴趣的学习者。全书共分三章，从方法论到专题研究再到比较视野，层层深入。\n\n第一章**史学理论与方法**讲解历史研究的基本方法论，包括史料学的基本原理、历史编纂的主要传统、不同历史学派的理论范式，帮助学生理解历史知识是如何被生产和建构的，培养对历史叙述的批判意识。第二章**专题史研究**选取经济史、社会史、思想文化史等重要分支领域，通过长时段和大主题的视角打破朝代和国别的限制，训练学生围绕一个核心问题进行深度历史分析的能力。第三章**比较历史**将中国历史置于世界历史的大框架中进行横向比较，通过中外制度、文化和发展道路的对比分析，帮助学生跳出单一视角，形成更开阔和深刻的历史认知。\n\n推荐先学习史学方法建立方法论基础，再以此为工具进入专题史和比较史的研究。历史进阶的学习离不开大量阅读原始史料和学术论著。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"historiography","title":"史学理论与方法","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/humanities-track/history-advanced/historiography","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"source-criticism","title":"文科方向 历史进阶 — 史料学基础","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/humanities-track/history-advanced/historiography/source-criticism"},{"seq":2,"slug":"historiographical-traditions","title":"文科方向 历史进阶 — 历史编纂传统","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/humanities-track/history-advanced/historiography/historiographical-traditions"},{"seq":3,"slug":"historical-schools","title":"文科方向 历史进阶 — 历史学流派","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/humanities-track/history-advanced/historiography/historical-schools"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"thematic-history","title":"专题史研究","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/humanities-track/history-advanced/thematic-history","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"economic-history","title":"文科方向 历史进阶 — 经济史专题","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/humanities-track/history-advanced/thematic-history/economic-history"},{"seq":2,"slug":"social-history","title":"文科方向 历史进阶 — 社会史专题","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/humanities-track/history-advanced/thematic-history/social-history"},{"seq":3,"slug":"intellectual-history","title":"文科方向 历史进阶 — 思想文化史专题","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/humanities-track/history-advanced/thematic-history/intellectual-history"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"comparative-history","title":"比较历史","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/humanities-track/history-advanced/comparative-history","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"institutional-comparison","title":"文科方向 历史进阶 — 制度比较","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/humanities-track/history-advanced/comparative-history/institutional-comparison"},{"seq":2,"slug":"cultural-comparison","title":"文科方向 历史进阶 — 文化比较","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/humanities-track/history-advanced/comparative-history/cultural-comparison"},{"seq":3,"slug":"modernization-paths","title":"文科方向 历史进阶 — 发展道路比较","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/humanities-track/history-advanced/comparative-history/modernization-paths"}]}]}